  "preconditions": [
    "Caller-supplied complete UTF-8 byte source or explicit ordered envelopes; native resources use their existing schemas. No project, loader, live basis or authorization is supplied to this pure transport layer."
  ],
  "steps": [
    "Decode multiple mixed native envelopes, re-encode their exact semantic values, compare canonical LF records and retain original source bytes/hash separately.",
    "Reject missing/extra/wrong transport fields, wrong payload kinds, incomplete native records, invalid local consistency, operations, result hashes and plan self-hashes without repair.",
    "Assert detached complete observations and no permission grant; trap file/network/process/write/generation/plan-execution calls and verify the same passive API in isolated Core and PYZ."
  ],
  "oracle": {
    "kind": "behavior",
    "requirement_contract": "NDJSON-Import und -Export MÜSSEN pro Zeile genau ein versioniertes SpecRoad-Artefakt oder Change-Plan-Objekt verarbeiten, leere Zeilen ignorieren und Kommentare ablehnen.",
    "scope": "14.g.W passive native NDJSON v1 codec over complete source bytes. All 28 supported artifact kinds and regular Change Plans are checked with existing field/local validators; explicit envelopes preserve values, field presence, source provenance, native versions/self-hashes, order and duplicates. Canonical full-envelope UTF-8 + LF output has no inferred metadata or publication side effect. Record iterators are partial until exhausted; whole-stream helpers return only after full validation. Transfer chunks and persistent continuation are not implemented in this W cut; no full CLI import/export or live-state authorization is claimed."
  },
